# lexicon_uk.src - Ukrainian words pointing at the same concepts as English.
#   label | pos | =english-word or ^concept or - | feats
# "=pylon" means: the concept the English word "pylon" has. The concepts are
# language neutral; this file only says which Ukrainian forms name them.
# Every form is listed (no endings are guessed). case: nom gen dat acc ins loc.
# compile.rex adds lang=uk, so the realiser never says these words.
# Architecture: Tom Dyer. This file: Claude (Opus 5.5).
#
